-- Persistent Stalkers: the skin of the main menu and its profile panel
-- (AGENTS.md, "Skins").
--
-- This is the default skin: it changes nothing, so the menu takes
-- persistent_stalkers_menu's DEFAULT_SKIN (G.A.M.M.A.'s background, the
-- options on the right, the full panel left to middle). Another skin is a
-- small mod that replaces this one file (and brings its own layout), such as
-- romeo\gamedata in this repo, for the CLIKRAD ROMEO menu.
--
-- get() returns the fields to change, or nil for none; see DEFAULT_SKIN in
-- persistent_stalkers_menu.script for what each one does.

function get()
	return nil
end
